name: commands
description: "The commands a doer runs in the task's shell, in its own process. A runner that intercepts them stops each before it runs, so a gate may ask about it; the command matches as one string."
verbs:
- name: run
  description: "Run a command in the task's shell."
  fields:
  - {name: command, form: text, description: "the command line, as the doer gave it"}
